  "keyFeatures": [
    "Real-time AR garment overlay at 30 FPS using MediaPipe pose detection and TFLite body segmentation",
    "AI avatar generation with face swap, body shape selection, and skin-tone matching",
    "Photo-realistic identity transfer via InstantID + SDXL Lightning",
    "Fit scoring engine (0–100) using industry ease allowances with 96.6% accuracy",
    "Returns-risk classifier with cost-sensitive threshold selection to minimise false positives",
    "Live virtual try-on via diffusion model with per-frame blending over WebSocket",
    "Occlusion handling for arms over garments using z-depth from pose landmarks",
    "Adaptive quality system (High/Medium/Low/Minimal) based on real-time FPS monitoring",
    "Zero paid APIs — fully open-source stack (MediaPipe, TFLite, InsightFace, CatVTON)"
  ],
