    "GarmentFitter (Dart) — computeTransform(BodyDimensions, GarmentConfig)",
    "BodyDimensionEstimator (Dart) — estimate(PoseResult)",
    "PerformanceOptimizer (Dart) — updateFPS(), currentQuality",
